        "title": "Markov Logic Processes: Neuro-Symbolic Reinforcement Learning via Association Rule Mining",
        "venue": "arXiv / Under Review",
        "year": 2025,
        "status": "upcoming",
        "url": "https://scholar.google.com",
        "summary": "Proposes MLP — a novel framework extending standard DQN with a symbolic reasoning module (LogosL) using Apriori-based association rule mining to augment Bellman targets via a potential-based reward shaping term φ_L. Evaluated on LunarLander-v3 under standard and turbulence conditions, achieving improved sample efficiency and stability.",
        "tags": ["Reinforcement Learning", "Neuro-Symbolic AI", "DQN", "Association Rule Mining", "PyTorch"],
        "coAuthors": ["Saiyam Jain"]
      },
      {
        "id": "paper-2",
        "title": "ISL Recognition via Dual-Glove Wearable Sensors: A Comparative Study on CNN-LSTM Architectures",
        "venue": "IEEE / Conference Proceedings",
        "year": 2024,
        "status": "upcoming",
        "url": "https://scholar.google.com",
        "summary": "Presents a wearable dual-glove prototype for Indian Sign Language recognition using flex sensors and IMUs, classified with a hybrid CNN-LSTM pipeline. Comparative evaluation against ASL reference datasets demonstrates cross-lingual sign language adaptability.",
        "tags": ["Sign Language", "CNN-LSTM", "IoT", "Wearable Tech", "TensorFlow"],
        "coAuthors": ["Saiyam Jain", "et al."]
      },
      {
