        "summary": "A wearable dual-glove device embedding flex sensors and inertial measurement units for capturing hand gestures corresponding to Indian Sign Language alphabets and words. The system processes sensor data through an on-device lightweight neural network to produce real-time text and speech output, enabling communication for the hearing-impaired.",
